import jax
import jax.numpy as jnp
from jax import vmap
from functools import partial


@partial(vmap, in_axes=(None, 0))
def f(y, x):
  return y * x 

x_var = 0.5 * jnp.ones((2, 5))
y = 0.2 * jnp.ones((3, 5))


def func(y_):
    return f(y_, x_var)

func(y)
Above will raise the same error if we pass x as kwarg:
def func(y_):
    return f(y_, x=x_var)
Take a look also of this discussion on kwargs and vmap: #13836 (comment)

